
err_constructor_calls_a_method.em:16  A constructor cannot call shout on the object it is building.

   16 |         print(self.shout())

  The object is not finished yet, and shout may be overridden by a subclass whose own fields are still unset.
  Call it after the object exists:  var it = Greeter(...)
  it.shout()

  emerald explain
